      "text": "Posts from Township Management carry an \"Official\" label. **Announcements** share news such as planned fogging or a water interruption, and **Safety alerts** warn about hazards such as monkeys near a block. Filter the feed by **Official** to see only these. The newest ones also appear at the top of Home."
