      "text": "Share things that help your neighbours, and pick the topic that fits:\n\n- **Lost & found**: pets, keys or parcels, with a photo and where they were last seen.\n- **Recommendations**: ask for or suggest a tutor, aircon technician or swimming coach.\n- **Giveaways**: things you no longer need, such as books, baby gear or furniture. (Share food on EcoFood instead.)\n- **Safety**: tips and heads-ups, such as someone trying car doors at night. Report hazards in TownCare too.\n- **Activities**: invitations to cycle, jog or play badminton together. For a proper event with RSVPs, create it in the Events tab.\n- **General**: thank-yous, questions and friendly updates.\n\nPosts can go to your own neighbourhood or to the whole township."
