      "text": "1. Open **EcoFood**. The **Available** tab lists food that neighbours and local shops are sharing right now.\r\n2. Narrow the list with the filters: food type (Cooked food, Bread & pastries, Fruit & vegetables, Groceries & dry goods, Drinks or Other), **Shared by** (Everyone, Neighbours or Local shops) and **Halal** (Any or Halal only).\r\n3. Each card shows the pickup time and place, the halal status, allergens and how many people have already asked.\r\n4. Tap a card to see the details, the pickup point on a map and the **Request this food** button."
