      "text": "1. Open your listing. You'll find it under **EcoFood → My food**, or from \"For you\" on Home.\r\n2. Under the requests, each neighbour is shown by block (or by name if they chose to show it), with their note.\r\n3. Tap **Confirm** for the person you choose. The listing becomes Reserved and they receive the pickup code. Tap **Decline** for anyone you can't help; they're told politely.\r\n4. At pickup, check that the code they show matches the one on your listing.\r\n5. Tap **Mark as collected**. The food's weight is added to the community's food saved.\r\n\r\nIf nobody has collected it yet and you change your mind, tap **Remove listing**. Anyone waiting is notified."
