      "text": "Township Management accounts see a **Township Management** section in the menu with:\n\n- **Dashboard**: key figures and charts for the whole township.\n- **Reports**: assign, update and reply to TownCare reports.\n- **Bookings**: approve hall requests and block slots for maintenance.\n- **Verifications**: approve new residents and local shops.\n- **Support tickets**: questions the assistant couldn't answer and requests from residents.\n\nThey can also post safety alerts that appear on residents' Home pages. Only Township Management can see residents' contact details."
