      "text": "Long-tailed macaques live in the green areas around City of Elmina. To keep them away:\r\n\r\n1. Never feed them, even from a distance.\r\n2. Keep bin lids closed, and don't leave food or rubbish bags outside.\r\n3. Close windows and doors when food is out.\r\n\r\nIf a monkey comes close, stay calm, avoid eye contact and back away slowly. If monkeys keep coming back to an area, report a Wildlife sighting in TownCare so the Wildlife & Safety team can respond."
